The Registration Authority provides this material on an "as is" basis and
disclaims all warranties, express or implied. Neither the Registration
Authority nor ISO accepts liability arising from its use.

The bundled schemas are a snapshot. The ISO 20022 Repository is maintained and
updated frequently, so check the official site for the current version. Each
schema records the toolchain and, where stated, the ISO 20022 version it was
generated from, in an XML comment at the top of the file.
